#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Nemate dopuštenje za uređaj tog klastera."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Ime: drugi klaster već upotrebljava ovo ime."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Klaster nije spremljen: netko drugi ga je promijenio od otvaranja obrasca ili zapisivanje nije uspjelo. Ponovno ga otvorite i ponovite promjenu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Klaster je spremljen."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Stanje klastera nije izmijenjeno: zapisivanje nije uspjelo. Provjerite dnevnik Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Klaster i njegova predmemorirana snimka su izbrisani. Njegov uređaj i grafovi su zadržani. Rasporednik nije kontaktiran."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Uređaj i njegovi grafovi su stvoreni."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Uređaj nije stvoren: klaster već ima uređaj, netko drugi ga je promijenio od otvaranja stranice ili ga je Cacti odbio. Provjerite dnevnik Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Klaster je pridružen uređaju."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klaster nije pridružen: uređaj ne postoji, nemate dopuštenje za njega, već je dodijeljen drugom klasteru ili ga je netko drugi promijenio od otvaranja stranice."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Dodani su grafovi koji nedostaju."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Nije dodan nijedan graf: klaster nema uređaj ili taj uređaj više ne postoji."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Pridruživanje klastera nije uklonjeno: netko drugi ga je promijenio od otvaranja stranice."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Pridruživanje klastera je uklonjeno. Uređaj i njegovi grafovi su zadržani."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Particije su ponovno indeksirane iz snimke."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Particije nisu ponovno indeksirane: uređaj je onemogućen ili izvan rada, stoga je Cacti preskočio njegov upit podataka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Particije nisu ponovno indeksirane: Cacti nije mogao izvršiti upit podataka. Provjerite dnevnik Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Particije nisu ponovno indeksirane: upit podataka za HPC Scheduler nije instaliran. Instalirajte predloške sa stranice stanja sustava."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Particije nisu ponovno indeksirane: klaster nema uređaj ili taj uređaj više ne postoji."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Predlošci za HPC Scheduler su instalirani."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Predlošci nisu instalirani: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Nadzorni prikaz"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Zapažanja nije bilo moguće učitati. Zamolite administratora da provjeri dnevnik dodatka."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Pregledajte skupine razloga čekanja i svježinu snimki na pregledu. Vjerodajnice, pridruživanja klastera i pravila održavanja proslijedite administratoru."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Ime: upotrijebite od 1 do 64 slova, znamenke, točke, crtice ili podvlake, počevši slovom ili znamenkom."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Ispitivač: odaberite jedan s popisa ispitivača."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Razdoblje prikupljanja: unesite cijele sekunde od %d do %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Prijenos: odaberite jedan s popisa prijenosa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: unesite apsolutnu putanju ili ostavite prazno za zadanu vrijednost ispitivača."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: ovo računalo i priključak nisu na popisu slurmrestd poslužitelja u Postavkama."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: unesite https:// URL bez korisničkog imena, upita ili odsječka; obični http:// dopušten je samo za povratnu (loopback) adresu."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "slurmrestd korisnik: upotrijebite najviše 64 slova, znamenke, točke, crtice ili podvlake, ili ostavite prazno za korisnički token."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Datoteka tokena: unesite apsolutnu putanju datoteke tokena na ispitivaču. Sam token se ovdje nikada ne unosi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Datoteka tokena: mape za datoteke tokena još nisu zadane. Zamolite administratora sustava Cacti da ih postavi u Postavke, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Datoteka tokena: datoteka se mora nalaziti unutar jedne od mapa za datoteke tokena definiranih u Postavkama (%s)."

